  "-12أ-": "The preceding text in the book was: ['We were told by Abu Hafs 'Umar al-Muqri' the Kattani, he informed us from Ahmad ibn Ibrahim al-Zurad, who narrated from Yusuf ibn Sa'id ibn Muslim al-Misisi, who was informed by 'Abd Allah ibn Zam'a, who related from Malik ibn Anas from az-Zuhri from Sa' id ibn al-Musayyab from Abu Hurayrah from the Prophet (peace be upon him) that: whoever forgets a prayer should perform it when he remembers; for verily, Allah Almighty says: 'Establish prayer for My remembrance.' [Surah Taha (20): Ayah 14].' , '71-', \"He informed me, 'Ali ibn Ahmad bin Musa al-Ahwazi Bukaysar (7), who narrated to us from Ahmad bin Muhammad bin Bakr, who narrated from ar-Rabi' bin Sulaiman, who narrated from 'Abd Allah bin Wahb, who narrated from Malik bin Anas from Yahya bin Said, who informed me from 'Ubadah bin al-Walid bin 'Ubadah bin as-Samit, who informed me from my father from 'Ubadah bin as-Samit said: We pledged allegiance to the Messenger of Allah, peace be upon him, for compliance and obedience in times of difficulty and ease, in contentment and compulsion.', \"(1, 2, 3, 5) are blank and erased in the original. (7) It is as such in the original, which is (with Bishka). (4) This portion of the page is a photocopy from page number 12B but it's smudged and the words 'until they reconcile' were added at the end. This is a scribal error.\"]. Translate the following Arabic text to English only: ",
